action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# fresh-install
# launch-args: --debug
# P92 on iPad: two items chosen from the real menu bar, with the pointer.
#   SIMCTL_CHILD_SCUI_P92_MODE=after zsh testapp/test_ios.zsh P92 --device "iPad Pro 11-inch (M5)" \
#       --debug --actionfile testapp/actions/ios/P92-press-in-the-menu-bar-ipad.actions
# The bar belongs to the system, not to the app, so nothing here goes by label: points, in a
# full-screen window 834 x 1210 (iPadOS 27 simulator). The pointer at the top edge brings the
# app name down; a click on the name opens the bar out, the menus centred: debugTarget 232,
# File 312, Edit 361, View 415, Window 484, Help 551, all at y 16 (re-measured 2026-10-20 from a
# simctl screenshot, after Format left the bar). The first row of an open menu is 40 points under the bar; View's AFTER-toolbar is its second row, at 450, 94.
# Expected: "last command: AFTER-newItem" after the first, then "AFTER-toolbar" and
# "commands chosen: 2". There is no Format menu on iPad: SwiftUI leaves it out, and so does this framework,
# even when the app fills textFormatting (2026-10-20); the second item is taken from View instead.
# iPad 上的 P92:用指標從真正的選單列選兩個項目。選單列屬於系統而不是 app,所以全部用座標。指標到頂端會帶出 app 名稱,
# 點名稱後選單列展開。預期:先是 last command: AFTER-newItem,再是 AFTER-toolbar,commands chosen: 2。iPad 上沒有 Format 選單，與 SwiftUI 相同。
sleep,,,,,,2500000,,ios
keydown,,,,,command,,hold Command,ios
key,,,,,j,,a command key: the system builds the bar,ios
keyup,,,,,command,,,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,300,3,client,,,1500000,the pointer at the top edge,ios
hover,400,12,client,,,1500000,stay on the bar,ios
click,215,14,client,left,,,the app name: the bar opens out,ios
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,ios
click,313,16,client,left,,,File,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,357,56,client,,,1500000,File is open: its first row,ios
click,357,56,client,left,,,AFTER-newItem,ios
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,ios
hover,300,300,client,,,1500000,last command: AFTER-newItem,ios
hover,300,3,client,,,1500000,the top edge again,ios
hover,400,12,client,,,1500000,,ios
click,215,14,client,left,,,the app name,ios
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,ios
click,415,16,client,left,,,View,ios
sleep,,,,,,1000000,,ios
hover,450,94,client,,,1500000,View is open: its second row (the first is the system's Customize Toolbar),ios
click,450,94,client,left,,,AFTER-toolbar,ios
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,ios
hover,300,300,client,,,1500000,last command: AFTER-toolbar and commands chosen: 2,ios
sleep,,,,,,500000,,ios
